  "notes": "Syngenta FRAC 7 + 3 premix (EPA label 2020-10-02). Barley, oats, rye, triticale and wheat: 10.0 to 13.7 fl oz per acre for head blight, applied from Feekes 10.3 (Zadoks 55) to Feekes 10.5.4 (Zadoks 71); at most 27.4 fl oz per acre per year for grain. For grain the label gives no day count: do not apply after Feekes 10.5.4 (kernel watery ripe). The 7 day by-crop PHI is the label's day count for wheat, barley and oats cut before grain harvest; rye and triticale fall back to the 30 day top-level value, the longest on the label. Not for use in California."
